title: "Inbound WhatsApp message (before)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Nothing open" as s0
  state "Message with no open item" as s1
  state "Acknowledged after STOP" as s2
  state "Acknowledged twice in a day" as s3
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s0: a day passes / patients on the number change
  s1 --> s2: a day passes / patients on the number change / the number confirms again
  s1 --> s3: patients on the number change
  s2 --> s1: a message arrives
  s3 --> s0: a day passes
  s3 --> s1: a message arrives
